    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/1561481b12a3af92cb9867db990050f8.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important news needs to be delivered. The blue crow must deliver this news to its destination. You must help him in this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move towards the destination together by overcoming obstacles. The blue crow gradually gains speed. Therefore, you must make quick decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting a high score is as important as reaching the destination. Therefore, try to collect as many crystals as possible and be the person with the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/01100c45bb5979a5b6b3620f5adc39c6.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game is played by one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The control is extremely simple. It is played with the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You need to get the crow to the target without hitting the targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The playing time varies depending on the person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It is prepared for 16:9 wide screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game does not require high computer hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Developed with Unreal Engine 5.2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Suitable for children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It helps people develop their reaction and decision-making speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/74e48e0f6cb8aa3dbe1b093881a0e493.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/1561481b12a3af92cb9867db990050f8.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important news needs to be delivered. The blue crow must deliver this news to its destination. You must help him in this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move towards the destination together by overcoming obstacles. The blue crow gradually gains speed. Therefore, you must make quick decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting a high score is as important as reaching the destination. Therefore, try to collect as many crystals as possible and be the person with the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/01100c45bb5979a5b6b3620f5adc39c6.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game is played by one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The control is extremely simple. It is played with the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You need to get the crow to the target without hitting the targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The playing time varies depending on the person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It is prepared for 16:9 wide screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game does not require high computer hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Developed with Unreal Engine 5.2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Suitable for children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It helps people develop their reaction and decision-making speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372190/extras/74e48e0f6cb8aa3dbe1b093881a0e493.avif?t=1735396307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
